     1	//! Raw declarations of the C runtime functions used by the original library.
     2	//!
     3	//! The C sources rely on `printf` (stdio), `memchr` (string.h) and `pow`
     4	//! (math.h). We bind to the very same libc/libm entry points instead of
     5	//! re-implementing them so that formatting and floating point results are
     6	//! bit-for-bit identical to the C build.
